Package: newscid
Version: 1.3.30-1
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Christopher Patrick Fair <christopherpatrickfair@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24.0), libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
Recommends: stockfish | fruit
Homepage: https://github.com/chrisfair/newscid
Description: Chess Information Database (Scid v4 compatible)
 NewScid is a Scid v4 database-compatible chess application built with Wails v2
 (Go backend) and Vue 3 (TypeScript).
 .
 Supports Scid .si4/.sn4/.sg4 databases, PGN import/export, UCI chess engine
 analysis, opening tree exploration, and tactical training.
